flowchart LR
    user[User / curl / browser]
    api[FastAPI /ask and /health]
    agent[Pydantic AI legal RAG agent]
    retriever[LegalRetriever]
    embed[Embedding endpoint\nqwen3-embedding:4b]
    chroma[(Chroma vector store\nembedded in Docker image)]
    llm[Generative LLM\nOllama or configured OpenAI-compatible endpoint]
    dvc[DVC pipeline\npreprocess -> chunk -> embed -> eval]
    pdf[Source PDF\nDVC-tracked]
    articles[Structured article JSON]
    chunks[Article chunks]
    mlflow[MLflow tracking\nparams + RAGAS faithfulness]
    reports[/reports artifacts\nMLflow screenshot + architecture]
    ci[GitHub Actions\nlint -> test -> rebuild index -> eval gate -> Docker push]

    user --> api
    api --> agent
    agent --> retriever
    retriever --> embed
    retriever --> chroma
    agent --> llm
    agent --> api
    api --> reports

    pdf --> dvc
    dvc --> articles
    articles --> chunks
    chunks --> embed
    embed --> chroma
    dvc --> mlflow
    mlflow --> reports
    ci --> dvc
    ci --> mlflow
